00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:45.950
Put a little country in
ya, for a little bit.

00:03:47.772 --> 00:03:51.700
♪ Baby don't be scared
'cause I'm scared too ♪

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.417
♪ I know love has burned
you a time or two ♪

00:03:55.417 --> 00:03:59.265
♪ And all that I ask is
for a single chance ♪

00:03:59.265 --> 00:04:03.340
