00:04:28.332 --> 00:04:29.495
- Come on Tim!

00:04:29.495 --> 00:04:31.270
- I didn't really feel
the heart in that one,

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:33.104
I really didn't feel the heart in that one

00:04:33.104 --> 00:04:36.842
♪ It can be so blind but
with your hand in mine ♪

00:04:36.842 --> 00:04:40.663
♪ I know everything will be just fine ♪

00:04:40.663 --> 00:04:42.595
