00:04:48.422 --> 00:04:51.255
(audience cheers)

00:04:52.514 --> 00:04:53.847
- You chose Tim!

00:04:57.795 --> 00:04:59.624
I think it was Disneyland.

00:04:59.624 --> 00:05:01.663
Y'all come here.

00:05:01.663 --> 00:05:03.409
Okay, I think I know what it was.

00:05:03.409 --> 00:05:04.877
It was Disneyland.

00:05:04.877 --> 00:05:05.710
- I know, it was.

00:05:05.710 --> 00:05:06.660
- It was Disneyland.
- Yeah.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.640
- All right, so Emily,
what made you choose him

00:05:08.640 --> 00:05:09.640
