00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:22.452
- Yeah!
- But that's why.

00:05:22.452 --> 00:05:23.627
- All right, all right.

00:05:23.627 --> 00:05:26.619
Well big thanks to Nick,
we wish you the best.

00:05:26.619 --> 00:05:27.501
- Thank you!

00:05:27.501 --> 00:05:29.301
- [Kelly] Congrats to Emily and Tim!

